    "guide.intro.h": "About this edition",
    "guide.intro.p1": "This handbook is a working companion to the practitioner tool. It is written for clinicians, facilitators, and educators delivering forest-based therapy. It assumes baseline clinical training and builds FBT-specific competence from there.",
